  "title": "Dave Cote to Participate in the J.P. Morgan Industrials Conference",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, March 16, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — GPGI, Inc. (NYSE: GPGI), a diversified multi-industry platform for companies with great positions in good industries, today announced Dave Cote, GPGI’s Executive Chairman, is participating in the J.P. Morgan Industrials Conference. Dave will participate in a fireside chat at the J.P. Morgan Industrials Conference in Washington, D.C. […]",
